    <task id="Id_616ea07a-e063-4452-bb25-c8e7be891a64" name="5.7.2 b) Verification rejected">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Revis&amp;atilde;o n&amp;atilde;o for bem-sucedida&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. a contratada deve rejeitar o modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e instruir as equipes de tarefas para alterar a informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e ressubmet&amp;ecirc;-lo para autoriza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contratada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
